# IslandAlertStack: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_IslandAlertStack.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
ptr glide 960 14 400
wait 1
ptr glide 1137 16 200
ptr click
ptr glide 1500 600 200
ipc island demo download
wait 1
shot below
note the island kept its content; a card under it holds the download alert (Open / Show in Folder work)
ipc island demo usb
wait 1
shot below-two
note "+1 waiting" and a card peeking under it
ptr glide 960 140 300
wait 6
shot held
note resting on the card holds them
ptr glide 1500 600 200
ptr glide 1137 16 300
ptr click
ptr glide 1500 600 200

look glass
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
ptr glide 960 14 400
wait 1
ptr glide 1137 16 200
ptr click
ptr glide 1500 600 200
ipc island demo download
wait 1
shot below
note the island kept its content; a card under it holds the download alert (Open / Show in Folder work)
ipc island demo usb
wait 1
shot below-two
note "+1 waiting" and a card peeking under it
ptr glide 960 140 300
wait 6
shot held
note resting on the card holds them
ptr glide 1500 600 200
ptr glide 1137 16 300
ptr click
ptr glide 1500 600 200
